---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions | DigiHawke Media"
  description="Terms and Conditions for DigiHawke Media. Review agreement terms, usage restrictions, intellectual property policies, and governing law guidelines."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-lowest to-background relative select-none">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--color-surface-container-low),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-left">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-4 text-glow-indigo">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
        Last Updated: July 15, 2026
      </p>
      
      <!-- Content Blocks -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-8">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using <a href="https://digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">digihawke.com</a>, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you must terminate your access to our website and services immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            The original designs, text, dynamic calculators, vector logos (including the red hawk head artwork), layouts, and stylesheets displayed on this site are the exclusive property of DigiHawke Media and are protected by applicable trademark and copyright laws. No content may be reproduced or distributed without our explicit written consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Use License</h2>
          <p>
            We grant you a temporary, non-transferable license to access our marketing calculators and request strategy audits for personal or corporate evaluations. Under this license, you may not:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-3">
            <li>Decompile or reverse-engineer any custom scripts.</li>
            <li>Use site materials for commercial redistribution.</li>
            <li>Submit fraudulent domain details or contact numbers.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            In no event shall DigiHawke Media or its founders be held liable for any damages (including, without limitation, loss of business data, revenue Plateaus, or server latencies) arising from the use of or inability to use the marketing frameworks on our website, even if notified of such possibilities.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">5. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms & Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. You agree that any legal dispute or litigation arising in connection with our services will fall under the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in <strong>Deoria, Uttar Pradesh, India</strong>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
          <h2 class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">6. Inquiries & Correspondence</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you need to report terms violations, coordinate licensing clearances, or send official notices, contact:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
            <div><strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:help@digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">help@digihawke.com</a></div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Office:</strong> Barhaj, Dist - Deoria , Gorakhpur. U.P - 274601, India</div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
